sequenceDiagram
    actor User as "User"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant ID as "identityService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    participant Entra as "entraId: External System"
    User->>UI: Enter credentials and select Login
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API->>+ID: Authenticate(username, password)
    ID->>DB: Load account, credential and status
    alt Local account valid and active
        ID-->>-API: Issue JWT/refresh token
        API-->>-UI: AuthenticationResult
        UI->>+API: GET /api/v1/auth/me
        API->>+ID: Resolve role and resource scope
        ID-->>UI: Role, warehouse/region/group/retailer scope
    else Invalid or inactive account
        ID-->>-API: Authentication error
        API-->>-UI: 401 with error message
    end
    opt Entra exchange
        User->>UI: Sign in with Entra
        UI->>+Entra: Complete identity sign-in
        Entra-->>-UI: Identity token
        UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/auth/entra/exchange
        API->>+ID: Validate token and link eligible account
        ID->>DB: Check account and assignments
        alt Eligible account
            ID-->>-API: Issue FSCM tokens
            API-->>-UI: AuthenticationResult
        else No eligible account
            API-->>UI: 401/403 access denied
        end
    end
    Note over UI,API: Google login is not exposed by the current backend contract.


